{"id":"n66591-9-7","stage":0,"title":"만나다 · 遇到","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66591-9-7-1","ko":"어린 나이에 벌써 회사 사장이야?","zh":"这么年轻就已经当上公司老板了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어린","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이에","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사장이야?","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]}],"audio":"/audio/aed8768a548b343bb128.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66591-9-7-2","ko":"부모 잘 만나서 그렇지. 뭐.","zh":"那是因为遇到了好父母啦，没什么特别的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"부모","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모：父母","readings":[{"term":"부모","audio":"/audio/881a8172c7dcec2e64dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29559","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"遇到","explanation":"만나다：遇到；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"9","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐.","meaning":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","explanation":"뭐：表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27525","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"881a8172c7dcec2e","term":"부모","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/881a8172c7dcec2e64dc.mp3","entryId":"29559","definition":"父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"遇到","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"因有缘而建立某种关系。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"27525","definition":"表示不用再多说什么，接受事实。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/55194c4abe53f0739291.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66591","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"9","sourceLevel":"초급","day":21,"sequenceScore":0.9949,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这么年轻就已经当上公司老板了？","那是因为遇到了好父母啦，没什么特别的。","阿姨，您一共有几个孩子呀？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这么年轻就已经当上公司老板了？","那是因为遇到了好父母啦，没什么特别的。","阿姨，您一共有几个孩子呀？"],"answer":1}]}
